    "quest.last_ember.nether_candle.stage.bright_heat.objective.defeat_blazes.tracker.complete_text": "火灾威胁已被测量。",
    "quest.last_ember.nether_candle.stage.bright_heat.objective.defeat_blazes.tracker.text": "击败 3 个火焰以进行下界之烛研究。",
