    ],
    "quest.last_ember.nether_candle.stage.bright_heat.scene.start_quest.action.start.lines.started": [
      "击败 3 只火焰并带上 2 根火焰棒。尊重火，但不要奉承它。"
    ],
    "quest.last_ember.nether_candle.stage.bright_heat.scene.start_quest.action.start.lines.unavailable": [
      "下界之烛课程目前尚未准备好。"
    ],
    "quest.last_ember.nether_candle.stage.bright_heat.ui.tracker_text": "击败 3 只火焰并带上 2 根火焰棒。",
    "quest.last_ember.nether_candle.stage.return.dialogue.turn_in.label": "关于下界之烛",
    "quest.last_ember.nether_candle.stage.return.dialogue.turn_in.lines": [
      "这是可以命名的火焰。危险，但有名字。"
    ],
    "quest.last_ember.nether_candle.stage.return.dialogue.turn_in.response.complete.label": "写下界之烛。",
    "quest.last_ember.nether_candle.stage.return.dialogue.turn_in.response.leave.label": "还没有。",
    "quest.last_ember.nether_candle.stage.return.scene.complete_quest.action.turn_in.lines.completed": [
      "好的。第二个注释是这样说的：有些火引导，有些火消耗，智慧始于了解差异。"
    ],
    "quest.last_ember.nether_candle.stage.return.scene.complete_quest.action.turn_in.lines.missing_objectives": [
      "下界之烛课程仍然缺少一些东西。"
    ],
    "quest.last_ember.nether_candle.stage.return.scene.complete_quest.action.turn_in.lines.missing_proof": [
      "在我们结束课程之前，将下界材料带到这里。"
    ],
    "quest.last_ember.nether_candle.stage.return.scene.complete_quest.action.turn_in.lines.unavailable": [
      "我现在无法关闭下界之烛。"
    ],
    "quest.last_ember.nether_candle.stage.return.scene.leave.lines": [
      "保持粉末密封。当他们不逃跑时，教训会更好。"
    ],
    "quest.last_ember.nether_candle.stage.return.ui.tracker_text": "带着下界之烛材料返回。",
